This plugin uses github.com/mmonterroca/docxgo/v2 (MIT License),
Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Misael Monterroca.

docxgo is used as a library for OOXML document construction and reading.
The plugin adds a security boundary in front of the library: workspace-confined
paths, ZIP/XML resource limits, macro/embedded-content rejection, image
re-encoding, and atomic output. See docs/docx-plugin-design.md in the golder
repository for the audit and threat model.

